0,Music of Hawaii - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Hawaii,"The music of Hawaii includes an array of traditional and popular styles, ranging from native Hawaiian folk music to modern rock and hip hop. Styles like slack-key guitar are well known worldwide, while Hawaiian-tinged music is a frequent part of Hollywood soundtracks.",Hawaiian,Austronesian
