3,Pacific Islander Musicians & Music - Demographic Resources in Music ...,https://libguides.uky.edu/music-demographic-research/PacificIslander,"Drawing together contemporary cultural studies and musical analysis, Austronesian Soundscapes will fill this research gap, offering a comprehensive analysis of traditional and contemporary Austronesian music and, at the same time, investigating how music reflects the challenges that Austronesian cultures face in this age of globalization.",Hawaiian,Austronesian
4,Austronesian Music - Music genre - Rate Your Music,https://rateyourmusic.com/genre/austronesian-music/,"Austronesian music nowadays refers to the ongoing evolution and fusion of various cultural influences from foreign and neighbouring cultures. These influences have over the centuries introduced new instruments, styles, and genres, blending age-old elements with newer traditions.",Hawaiian,Austronesian
5,Austronesian Music - Melodigging,https://www.melodigging.com/genre/austronesian-music,"Austronesian music is an umbrella term for the diverse musical traditions of Austronesian-speaking peoples, whose homelands stretch from Taiwan through Island Southeast Asia to Oceania and Madagascar.",Hawaiian,Austronesian
